## Expected Outcomes (After Phase 3)

After following this teaching:

- [ ] `framework/skills/` has 8 files with use_cases and tests
- [ ] `EXTENSION.md` exists with all 5 sections
- [ ] `WAI-Manifest.yaml` has updated skills_loaded
- [ ] Any WAI-Backpressure.yaml migrated to qc-check override
- [ ] All changes committed to `wai-v2-migration` branch
- [ ] WAI-MIGRATION.yaml updated with Phase 3 commit hash

If any outcome is missing:
- [ ] RED LIGHT: Return to the step that should have created it
- [ ] Check the example in `framework/templates/` for reference
- [ ] Consult decision lug: `hub/intake/wai-v2-migration/decision.lug.json`

